# Bytes, not line endings.
#
# This repository carries a deliberate mix of CRLF and LF files (main.py and
# most of actions/ are CRLF; the Phase 1+ files are LF). Without this file,
# any checkout with core.autocrlf=true rewrites the CRLF ones and every diff
# that touches them explodes into thousands of phantom changed lines — which
# is exactly how a one-line edit ends up looking like a rewrite.
* -text
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.obj binary
*.woff2 binary
